      "cooked": "<p>I didn't see any where else to post it, if I'm at he wrong location sorry. &nbsp;I've been a fan of sentinels for a few years only just started playing since the digital release due to not having a regular gaming group, that would play it. &nbsp;With tactics it might be easier to get people to play it, but I would like to play it a few times to see if it is worth the investment. &nbsp;So I'm hoping someone in the seattle that wouldn't mind meeting up to playa few so I can try it out. &nbsp;Thanks for any help in advance.</p>",
